  "title": "Slow Cooker Mexican Pork Stew with Sweet Potatoes",
  "description": "This slow-cooker Mexican pork stew recipe combines pork loin, sweet potatoes, fire-roasted tomatoes, and green chiles to produce a flavorful pork stew.",
